===== 4. Errores que el examen pregunta (ninguno cambia nada: Oracle se protege) =====
4a. Borrar el grupo CURRENT -> ORA-01623: log 3 is current log for instance FREE (thread 1) - cannot drop
4b. Borrar un miembro del grupo CURRENT -> ORA-01609: log 3 is the current log for thread 1 - cannot drop members
4c. Borrar otro grupo dejando uno solo -> ORA-01624: log 1 needed for crash recovery of instance FREE (thread 1)

